<title>POLAND: Mostostal-Z plunges on halted contract.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-Z plunges on halted contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Mostostal Zabrze SA plunged 9.3 percent to 10.7 zlotys in 0.4-million-zloty turnover on a court decision to halt its contract to build a radio and TV mast, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Mostostal collapsed today like the mast,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>On Monday Mostostal fell 1.7 percent.</p>
<p>The 25-million-zloty project was halted last week after local residents in Gabin, central Poland, argued that the electromagnetic waves from the mast could harm their health.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
